// PYI019(n): findings from clauses `custom-type-var-for-self`, `custom-type-var-for-self-parenthesized-return`, which say the same.
// Each rule is one way a JSON `rule` can match.
// Columns after `at` are the metavariables the JSON's message, anchor or `each` names: one finding per distinct row.
.violation PYI019(at: node, r: node, n: loc) "Replace the custom type variable `{n}` with `Self` (from `typing`, or `typing_extensions` before 3.11): drop the first parameter's annotation and use `Self` for `{n}` here."
